OL,3,GNEWSACrane causes 'severe delays' at
OL,4,ADartford Crossing
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere are severe delays at the Dartford
OL,7,FCrossing between Kent and Essex due to
OL,8,Fa broken-down crane which is leaking
OL,9,Foil, according to National Highways.
OL,11,FThe government agency said the west
OL,12,F(left) bore of the tunnel was closed as
OL,13,Fteams worked to remove the stranded
OL,14,F50-tonne vehicle.
OL,16,FSpecialist recovery works are ongoing,
OL,17,Fand clean up of the oil spill will have
OL,18,Fto be complete before the A282 which
OL,19,Flinks the southern and northern
OL,20,Fsections of the M25 can reopen.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
