OL,3,GNEWSACrane causes 'severe delays' at
OL,4,ADartford Crossing
OL,5,
OL,6,FNational Highways said shortly before
OL,7,F20:30 BST there were delays of one hour
OL,8,Fwith congestion backing up to junction
OL,9,Fthree for the M20.
